This project uses a dedicated utility module (utils.py) to keep the code clean, modular, and reusable. These utilities handle common operations such as data loading, preprocessing, KPI calculations, and model predictions.

🔧 Key Utilities Used
Data Loading
Efficiently loads datasets using Pandas
Handles file errors gracefully
Data Preprocessing
Converts date columns into datetime format
Extracts features like Year, Month, Day
Handles missing values
Feature Engineering
Creates additional features like:
Hour of crime
Day of week
Improves model performance and insights
KPI Calculations
Total number of crimes
Arrest rate (%)
Most frequent crime type
Filtering Functions
Filter data by:
Year
Crime type
Used in interactive dashboard controls
Aggregation Functions
Crime trends over time
Top crime categories
Supports visualization charts
Model Utilities
Load trained ML models (joblib)
Perform predictions on new data
📁 File Structure Reference
utils.py        # Contains all helper functions
app.py          # Main Streamlit dashboard
